---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { stories } from '../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="Stories — Gempala"><section class="page-hero shell"><div class="section-kicker eyebrow">NOT NEWSROOM. OUR JOURNAL.</div><h1 class="display xl">STORIES<br/>WE KEEP.</h1><p class="lead">Catatan kegiatan, orang, dan momen yang layak disimpan lebih lama dari satu Instagram Story.</p></section><section class="section stories"><div class="shell story-list">{stories.map((s,index)=><article class="story"><div class:list={['story-cover',index===1&&'blue',index===2&&'orange']}><span>STORY / {String(index+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span></div><div class="story-copy"><div><span class="eyebrow">{s.date}</span><span class="label">{s.tag}</span></div><h2>{s.title}</h2><p>Arsip cerita Gempala. Konten lengkap dapat ditambahkan dari data statis atau database ketika modul editorial diaktifkan.</p><a href="#">READ STORY ↗</a></div></article>)}</div></section><style>.stories{background:var(--blue);border-top:var(--line)}.story-list{display:grid;gap:28px}.story{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;border:var(--line);box-shadow:var(--shadow);border-radius:var(--radius);overflow:hidden;background:var(--white)}.story-cover{min-height:360px;background:var(--lime);border-right:var(--line);display:grid;place-items:center}.story-cover.blue{background:var(--purple)}.story-cover.orange{background:var(--orange)}.story-cover span{padding:8px;background:var(--paper);border:var(--line);font:800 9px Archivo;transform:rotate(-3deg)}.story-copy{padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.story-copy>div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between}.story-copy h2{font:900 clamp(34px,5vw,63px)/.98 Archivo;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:45px 0 18px}.story-copy p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;max-width:600px}.story-copy a{font:900 11px Archivo;margin-top:auto;align-self:flex-end;border-bottom:2px solid var(--ink);padding-bottom:6px}@media(max-width:800px){.story{grid-template-columns:1fr}.story-cover{min-height:270px;border-right:0;border-bottom:var(--line)}.story-copy{min-height:330px}}</style></BaseLayout>
